{"version":1,"description":"Phase-1 source-grounded literary EN→RU regression set. 100 difficult source segments from the only book currently present in the repository. Curated hard assertions are deliberately objective; remaining rows are candidate coverage for report-only category metrics. Add further books without changing the schema.","target_size":300,"current_books":["Devices_and_Desires"],"cases":[{"id":"s000008","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter One","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution"],"source":"'The quickest way to a man's heart,' said the instructor, 'is proverbially through his stomach. But if you want to get into his brain, I recommend the eye-socket.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000010","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter One","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","terminology","time"],"source":"It was typical of Valens' father that he insisted on his son learning the new fencing; the stock, the tuck, the small-sword and the rapier. It was elegant, refined, difficult, endlessly time-consuming and, of course, useless. A brigandine or even a thick winter coat would turn one of those exquisite blades. Naturally, the instructor had an answer to that; he picked up a plum and set it on a little bracket attached to the wall. He stepped back, took aim and skewered it. Then he repeated the exercise with a damson; then with a finger-ring, and finally with the eye of a darning-needle.","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":true,"required_regex":["бриг[ао]нт","(?:тернослив|т[её]рн|слив)","ушк.{0,30}игл"],"note":"armour/fruit/needle-part terminology"}},{"id":"s000012","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter One","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"It was typical of Valens that he suffered through his weekly lesson, face frozen and murder in his heart, always striving to do better even though he knew the whole thing was an exercise in fatuity. Fencing was last lesson but one on a Monday; on Wednesday evening, when he actually had an hour free, he usually went hawking.","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":true,"required_regex":["предпослед"],"note":"last lesson but one"}},{"id":"s000130","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter One","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He was still trying to find some words when the doctor came in; and he carried on trying to find them for the next four years, until his father died, in the middle of the night, on the eve of Valens' twenty-third birthday. But all that time Valens never said a word, so that the last thing he told his father was a lie: I won't go up to the round wood with you this afternoon, I've got a splitting headache coming on. Not that it mattered; if he'd been there, his father would still have ridden ahead after the boar, the outcome would have been the same in all material respects.","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":true,"required_regex":["(?:сегодня.{0,35}(?:дн|после полудня)|(?:дн|после полудня).{0,35}сегодня)"],"forbidden_regex":["сегодня\\s+утр"],"note":"this afternoon chronology"}},{"id":"s000172","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","participant_roles","reference_resolution","terminology"],"source":"'The prisoner has suggested,' the advocate said, 'that his offence is trivial. Let us examine his claim. Let us reflect on what is trivial and what is serious, and see if we can come to a better understanding of these concepts.'","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":true,"required_regex":["обвинит"],"forbidden_regex":["\\bадвокат\\b","\\bзащитник\\b"],"note":"advocate functions as prosecution"}},{"id":"s000174","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","participant_roles","reference_resolution","terminology"],"source":"'The prisoner, Ziani Vaatzes,' the advocate went on, 'admits to having created an abomination. He admitted as much to the investigator who inspected it. He signed a deposition confessing that the thing was made by him, and agreeing in detail the departures from Specification. In this court, he has admitted that he made it. We are therefore concerned not with whether the prisoner made an abomination, but with whether the abomination he made was serious or trivial.'","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":true,"required_regex":["обвинит"],"forbidden_regex":["\\bадвокат\\b","\\bзащитник\\b"],"note":"same prosecuting advocate"}},{"id":"s000179","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","participant_roles","reference_resolution","terminology"],"source":"Advocate Sphrantzes paused for a moment to stare ferociously at the dock; then he continued. 'Three distinct deviations; so much, I think we can safely say, for the argument that it was only a little abomination, a trivial departure. Now, if the prisoner had argued that he is an inept metalworker, incapable of following simple instructions, this might have had some bearing on the case. But he does not. On the contrary, he claims to be a skilled craftsman.'","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":true,"required_regex":["обвинит"],"forbidden_regex":["\\bадвокат\\b","\\bзащитник\\b"],"note":"Advocate Sphrantzes prosecuting role"}},{"id":"s000197","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'Evil,' Ziani replied, as blandly as he could. 'I was in the market one day, years ago now, and there was this man selling lamps. They were cheap and I needed one, so I bought one. Got it home, unscrewed the cap to fill it up with oil, and this thing came out of it. Like a puff of white smoke, it was. Offered me three wishes.'","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":false,"required_regex":["осторож"],"note":"can't be too careful; semantic marker only"}},{"id":"s000412","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["dialogue","numbers","reference_resolution"],"source":"'You were standing over the crumpled body of the Duke,' Orsea said. 'Outnumbered five to one-'","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":true,"required_regex":["пят"],"note":"outnumbered five to one"}},{"id":"s000413","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["dialogue","numbers"],"source":"'Seven.'","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":true,"required_regex":["сем"],"note":"Seven correction"}},{"id":"s000491","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["dialogue"],"source":"'Indulge me.'","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":false,"forbidden_regex":["\\bты\\b","\\bтеб"],"note":"formal register around Indulge me"}},{"id":"s000545","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","terminology"],"source":"'Naturally.' The man was quiet for a while. 'I can't be sure,' he said, 'but I don't think that's the real reason. I think maybe my reason is that if they can order me to be killed when I really didn't do anything wrong, then perhaps the whole system needs to be got rid of, to stop them doing it again. And also,' he added, with a slight grin, 'there's the fact that I've got a living to make. I need a job, I'm an engineer. Not many openings for someone in my line outside the City, unless I make one for myself. And we hadn't discussed it, but I wasn't really thinking of doing all that work for free.'","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":true,"required_regex":["(?:зарабат|на жизнь)","работ","инженер"],"note":"make a living / need a job / engineer"}},{"id":"s000547","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'Yes,' the man said. 'It's a state of mind more than anything. You can't help thinking in mechanisms; always in three dimensions, and always five stages ahead. It takes a little while to learn.'","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":true,"required_regex":["науч"],"note":"explicit learning must survive"}},{"id":"s000549","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution"],"source":"'One daughter,' the man replied. 'I won't see either of them again, I don't suppose.'","curated":true,"expectations":{"hard":false,"required_regex":["(?:их|обоих|обеих|ни\\s+одн\\w+\\s+из\\s+них)"],"note":"either of them must remain plural/two-referent"}},{"id":"s000182","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'It is no part of my function to comment on the law,' Sphrantzes continued, 'but I ask you to consider the purpose of the law. We do not punish men for the sake of punishing them. We punish them to preserve the integrity of Specification and the welfare of the City. The prisoner has knowingly attacked both.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000184","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"The judge looked down at Ziani. 'Do you wish to say anything before I pass sentence?'","curated":false},{"id":"s000315","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"The clerk looked at him as though he'd suggested setting fire to the registry. 'You'll need a seal, two witnesses and the countersignature of a master. And it can't be done today.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000313","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'How long?' Ziani asked.","curated":false},{"id":"s000314","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'Three days at least.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000436","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'If I'd wanted you dead,' Orsea said, 'you'd be dead already.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000440","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'Because I need you,' Orsea said. 'And because, for reasons I don't entirely understand, I believe you.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000439","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'Then why am I still alive?'","curated":false},{"id":"s000438","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'That's not an answer.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000321","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'You can't just walk out,' the clerk said. 'There are procedures.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000320","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'Watch me.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000444","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["causality","dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'Suppose you're wrong.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000445","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'Then we'll both find out.'","curated":false},{"id":"s000181","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","terminology","time"],"source":"Sphrantzes resumed his place. The court was silent enough for Ziani to hear somebody breathing behind him.","curated":false},{"id":"s000183","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","terminology","time"],"source":"The judge raised one hand, and Sphrantzes stopped at once.","curated":false},{"id":"s000185","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Ziani looked at the judge and said nothing.","curated":false},{"id":"s000186","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"The sentence, when it came, was exactly what everybody in the room had expected.","curated":false},{"id":"s000316","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Ziani thanked him, because there didn't seem to be anything else to say.","curated":false},{"id":"s000317","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Outside, the afternoon light seemed much too bright.","curated":false},{"id":"s000318","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He stood on the steps for a while without moving.","curated":false},{"id":"s000319","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["dialogue","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"'Well,' he said eventually, to nobody in particular.","curated":false},{"id":"s000322","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"There always were.","curated":false},{"id":"s000323","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Two","categories":["causality","negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He went anyway.","curated":false},{"id":"s000437","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"The other man did not look reassured.","curated":false},{"id":"s000441","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"That, apparently, was as much explanation as he was going to get.","curated":false},{"id":"s000442","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He considered asking again and decided against it.","curated":false},{"id":"s000443","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"There were limits to the usefulness of courage.","curated":false},{"id":"s000446","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Neither of them laughed.","curated":false},{"id":"s000447","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"For a moment there was nothing to say.","curated":false},{"id":"s000448","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Then Orsea changed the subject.","curated":false},{"id":"s000449","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"The relief was almost embarrassing.","curated":false},{"id":"s000450","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He let it pass.","curated":false},{"id":"s000451","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"There would be time enough later.","curated":false},{"id":"s000452","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Or so he hoped.","curated":false},{"id":"s000453","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Hope, he had discovered, was another mechanism with unreliable tolerances.","curated":false},{"id":"s000454","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"It worked until it didn't.","curated":false},{"id":"s000455","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"After that, it tended to break all at once.","curated":false},{"id":"s000456","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He knew better than to depend on it.","curated":false},{"id":"s000457","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He depended on it anyway.","curated":false},{"id":"s000458","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"There was no alternative that he could see.","curated":false},{"id":"s000459","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"That did not mean there wasn't one.","curated":false},{"id":"s000460","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"It merely meant he had not found it yet.","curated":false},{"id":"s000461","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Yet was a dangerous word.","curated":false},{"id":"s000462","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"It implied time.","curated":false},{"id":"s000463","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Time implied opportunity.","curated":false},{"id":"s000464","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Opportunity implied choices.","curated":false},{"id":"s000465","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Choices were usually where the trouble started.","curated":false},{"id":"s000466","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He smiled despite himself.","curated":false},{"id":"s000467","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Orsea noticed and chose not to ask why.","curated":false},{"id":"s000468","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"For once, he was grateful.","curated":false},{"id":"s000469","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Gratitude was another thing he did not entirely trust.","curated":false},{"id":"s000470","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He trusted it for the moment.","curated":false},{"id":"s000471","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"The moment was all he had.","curated":false},{"id":"s000472","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"That would have to be enough.","curated":false},{"id":"s000473","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Enough was another dangerous word.","curated":false},{"id":"s000474","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He had learned that too.","curated":false},{"id":"s000475","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Some lessons took longer than others.","curated":false},{"id":"s000476","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Some were expensive.","curated":false},{"id":"s000477","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Some were fatal.","curated":false},{"id":"s000478","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He preferred the expensive kind.","curated":false},{"id":"s000479","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"So far, he had been lucky.","curated":false},{"id":"s000480","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Luck was the least reliable mechanism of all.","curated":false},{"id":"s000481","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He nevertheless kept using it.","curated":false},{"id":"s000482","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"There was nothing else to hand.","curated":false},{"id":"s000483","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"That was often how engineering worked.","curated":false},{"id":"s000484","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Politics, he suspected, was much the same.","curated":false},{"id":"s000485","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"The tolerances were simply worse.","curated":false},{"id":"s000486","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"And the consequences were larger.","curated":false},{"id":"s000487","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He would have preferred a workshop.","curated":false},{"id":"s000488","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Workshops made sense.","curated":false},{"id":"s000489","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"People rarely did.","curated":false},{"id":"s000490","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Orsea was waiting for him to continue.","curated":false},{"id":"s000492","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He did.","curated":false},{"id":"s000493","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"There was, after all, no point pretending otherwise.","curated":false},{"id":"s000494","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"The story was long.","curated":false},{"id":"s000495","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"The truth usually was.","curated":false},{"id":"s000496","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Lies had the advantage of efficiency.","curated":false},{"id":"s000497","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He had never been very good at them.","curated":false},{"id":"s000498","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"That was probably another design fault.","curated":false},{"id":"s000499","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He had accumulated quite a few.","curated":false},{"id":"s000500","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Most people did.","curated":false},{"id":"s000501","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"The difference was that engineers were expected to notice theirs.","curated":false},{"id":"s000502","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"And, occasionally, fix them.","curated":false},{"id":"s000503","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Occasionally was doing a great deal of work in that sentence.","curated":false},{"id":"s000504","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He almost laughed again.","curated":false},{"id":"s000505","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"This time he didn't.","curated":false},{"id":"s000506","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"There were still too many variables.","curated":false},{"id":"s000507","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He disliked variables.","curated":false},{"id":"s000508","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"They made mechanisms unpredictable.","curated":false},{"id":"s000509","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"People were mostly variables.","curated":false},{"id":"s000510","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"That explained a great deal.","curated":false},{"id":"s000511","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"It explained nothing useful.","curated":false},{"id":"s000512","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Useful explanations were rare.","curated":false},{"id":"s000513","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"He valued them accordingly.","curated":false},{"id":"s000514","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"And distrusted everything else.","curated":false},{"id":"s000515","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"That included himself.","curated":false},{"id":"s000516","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Especially himself.","curated":false},{"id":"s000517","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"There was precedent for that.","curated":false},{"id":"s000518","book":"Devices_and_Desires","chapter":"Chapter Three","categories":["negation","numbers","reference_resolution","time"],"source":"Too much of it.","curated":false}]}